WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Safex

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:07.133
Grandfather from dreams

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:11.143
Grandfather William!

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:13.671
Grandfather William!

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:19.975
Candy feels so excited.

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:25.555
Grandfather William
who gave her all kinds of happiness...

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:30.386
is now staying in the hospital
where she works.

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:08.534
Grandfather William, I’m Candy.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:15.337
Grandfather William.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:24.409
Grandfather William, I miss you so much.

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:28.448
It all began the day
when the Adley family adopted me...

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:34.860
Lakewood, London,
there are memories thought my youth.

00:01:41.668 --> 00:01:45.331
I betrayed your kindness...

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:47.771
gave up the identity
of the Adley family.

00:01:55.482 --> 00:01:57.473
Grandfather William.

00:01:57.817 --> 00:02:01.776
I will help you recover
as soon as possible.

00:02:05.091 --> 00:02:06.456
Grandfather...

00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:10.462
If you already forgiven me,
I would like to tell you...

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:15.397
It's Candy.
Your adopted daughter Candy.

00:02:19.506 --> 00:02:21.497
Allow me...

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:26.778
Grandfather.

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:28.710
Doctor Frank.

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:43.827
Doctor!

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:46.190
It's the pillow!

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.194
You are new.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:53.205
Stay calm to be able to judge.

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:54.604
I am sorry!

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:58.041
While you diagnosed Grandfather William...

00:02:58.111 --> 00:02:59.874
the curtain...

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:04.508
Yes. No one can enter except me.

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:10.152
Excuse me.

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:14.460
Candy! It's time for class.

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:30.676
There are different ways
to take care of a baby and an adult.

00:03:33.313 --> 00:03:36.771
I'll show you today
how to look after a baby.

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:43.982
Grandfather William
is difficult to get along with.

00:03:44.324 --> 00:03:47.782
I must open his heart.

00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:50.389
Dim-wit!

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:56.600
Candy! A question for you!

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:58.431
Yes!

00:03:58.504 --> 00:04:02.065
What am I teaching today? Answer me!

00:04:02.141 --> 00:04:04.905
It's...

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:09.304
About lovely babies.

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:13.016
It's not mother's class here.

00:04:14.354 --> 00:04:15.787
Sorry!

00:04:16.556 --> 00:04:20.925
Candy, what's the age of baby?

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.889
It's...

00:04:24.564 --> 00:04:26.589
What's the age?

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:28.691
I'm asking you.

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:32.731
Franny!

00:04:32.939 --> 00:04:35.339
Yes.
A baby is until two years old.

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:38.036
Good! I have a baby here.

00:04:38.177 --> 00:04:41.613
Before you look after a baby,
you must understand that

00:04:41.748 --> 00:04:45.343
a baby is not a little adult.

00:04:45.685 --> 00:04:47.050
Headmistress!

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:49.385
What's the matter?

00:04:49.455 --> 00:04:51.946
How should I take care of a patient...

00:04:52.025 --> 00:04:54.493
older than me?

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:57.358
We are talking about babies now.

00:04:57.764 --> 00:05:02.224
I'd like to know
the caring of old patients.

00:05:02.302 --> 00:05:05.829
Shut up! The study has its priority!

00:05:06.005 --> 00:05:07.529
Yes!

00:05:07.607 --> 00:05:09.973
What's that attitude?

00:05:10.076 --> 00:05:11.543
Yes!

00:05:26.626 --> 00:05:29.186
Mr. William never talks with the nurses.

00:05:29.329 --> 00:05:30.591
Why?

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.660
He only talks with doctor Frank.

00:05:33.733 --> 00:05:36.463
He never treats us as people.

00:05:37.804 --> 00:05:39.931
The Grandfather...

00:05:40.006 --> 00:05:43.373
No,
Mr. William is not that kind of man.

00:05:44.644 --> 00:05:46.305
How do you know that?

00:05:46.379 --> 00:05:47.971
I know.

00:05:55.254 --> 00:05:56.881
A man like that...

00:05:56.956 --> 00:05:59.925
would have never adopted me
as his daughter.

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:23.708
Grandfather William!

00:06:30.957 --> 00:06:32.720
He has woken up.

00:06:36.863 --> 00:06:39.559
He is as quiet as Anthony.

00:06:42.668 --> 00:06:45.228
As if he was thinking all the time.

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:55.142
Grandfather William, I am Candy.

00:06:57.617 --> 00:07:01.644
Grandfather,
I will do my best to look after you.

00:07:03.122 --> 00:07:06.250
To meet you here...

00:07:06.325 --> 00:07:10.694
I'd like to thank you from my heart.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:14.161
You helped me so much! Thank you!

00:07:16.436 --> 00:07:19.405
I wanted all the time to see you.

00:07:22.742 --> 00:07:27.975
Grandfather, are you still angry
because I left school?

00:07:29.015 --> 00:07:30.710
Get out!

00:07:30.783 --> 00:07:32.478
Grandfather!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:38.386
Get out!
I never met a nurse so noisy.

00:07:39.759 --> 00:07:43.695
Grandfather, won't you forgive me?

00:07:45.565 --> 00:07:47.328
What's matter with you...

00:07:47.633 --> 00:07:49.328
you keep talking to yourself.

00:07:49.402 --> 00:07:51.165
That's because...

00:07:51.237 --> 00:07:53.797
I never expect
that I could meet you here.

00:07:53.873 --> 00:07:56.068
I can't help that.

00:07:56.142 --> 00:07:59.634
Give me a quiet nurse, anyway!

00:07:59.846 --> 00:08:03.748
Grandfather,
it's me, don't you remember?

00:08:04.784 --> 00:08:06.547
Stop this nonsense...

00:08:06.786 --> 00:08:09.914
I am your adopted daughter,
Candice White.

00:08:10.756 --> 00:08:13.418
I don't have a daughter like you.

00:08:13.659 --> 00:08:18.460
Candice White Adley,
have you heard this name before?

00:08:18.965 --> 00:08:23.026
Adley? Boring.

00:08:25.571 --> 00:08:29.439
Is this man really my grandfather?

00:08:33.079 --> 00:08:34.979
Grandfather William!

00:08:35.882 --> 00:08:39.841
Don't call me grandfather!
I am William McGregor.

00:08:40.987 --> 00:08:42.682
Mr. McGregor?

00:08:44.824 --> 00:08:48.089
I mistook him for grandfather William.

00:08:52.331 --> 00:08:53.662
That's it.

00:08:53.733 --> 00:08:57.794
Mr. McGregor,
have you heard about William Adley?

00:08:58.304 --> 00:09:01.796
I heard about the Adley family,
but I don't know any of them.

00:09:03.709 --> 00:09:07.577
My family is a prestigious family.

00:09:07.914 --> 00:09:12.476
As a prestigious family,
then you heard about William Adley?

00:09:13.019 --> 00:09:17.820
So, you were adopted by the Adleys.

00:09:19.025 --> 00:09:21.391
To adopt a daughter like you...

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:24.327
The Adley family is really boring
like the rumors say.

00:09:24.397 --> 00:09:26.194
Boring?

00:09:28.234 --> 00:09:29.861
Just like you.

00:09:29.936 --> 00:09:32.905
Mistook me for somebody else,
but you are still noisy.

00:09:33.339 --> 00:09:36.706
You are the one who is super boring.

00:09:36.876 --> 00:09:38.810
What did you say ?

00:09:38.978 --> 00:09:44.143
Your name is William too,
but you are completely different.

00:09:44.951 --> 00:09:46.919
What do you say?

00:09:50.356 --> 00:09:52.051
Mr. McGregor.

00:09:53.459 --> 00:09:54.926
Doctor!

00:09:55.494 --> 00:09:58.725
Doctor Frank, quickly!

00:09:59.699 --> 00:10:02.463
Stiff neck again?

00:10:03.402 --> 00:10:05.529
Prepare for injection, quick!

00:10:06.072 --> 00:10:07.664
Yes!

00:10:21.487 --> 00:10:23.455
Let him sleep for a while.

00:10:25.391 --> 00:10:28.952
Don't irritate the patient excessively.

00:10:29.028 --> 00:10:32.964
It's all my fault, I am sorry!

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:45.204
Dim-wit!

00:10:46.312 --> 00:10:49.179
Don't you yet admit that
you are a dim-wit?

00:10:49.248 --> 00:10:51.876
Yes, I admit that.

00:10:52.318 --> 00:10:54.684
Quarrelling with the patient...

00:10:54.754 --> 00:10:57.814
there's no such nurse in the world.

00:10:57.890 --> 00:11:00.916
I mistook him for my benefactor.

00:11:02.028 --> 00:11:05.429
The name William
is very common in America.

00:11:05.531 --> 00:11:07.726
It's not the reason I mistook him for.

00:11:07.967 --> 00:11:10.595
It is said that
he has lands and villas.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:13.704
It's also common too.

00:11:14.373 --> 00:11:15.533
I am sorry!

00:11:15.841 --> 00:11:20.335
Anyway, Franny will return
to look after Mr. McGregor.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:23.314
Am I dismissed?

00:11:23.382 --> 00:11:25.816
Take a day off tomorrow.

00:11:27.486 --> 00:11:28.851
To introspect?

00:11:29.555 --> 00:11:31.614
Take a walk in the park.

00:11:31.691 --> 00:11:32.783
The park?

00:11:32.858 --> 00:11:35.759
That place is suitable for a dim-wit.

00:11:45.271 --> 00:11:48.240
It is not too bad anyway...

00:11:49.075 --> 00:11:52.044
you have worked for a day at least.

00:11:52.611 --> 00:11:54.374
I am sorry, Franny!

00:11:55.214 --> 00:11:56.943
Forget it!

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:06.648
I'm happy for grandfather William that
he's not an odd man like Mr. McGregor.

00:12:08.694 --> 00:12:11.663
Candy,
are you ready for the practice tomorrow?

00:12:12.431 --> 00:12:14.558
I don't have to be ready for anything.

00:12:15.901 --> 00:12:18.665
I'm going to the park tomorrow.

00:12:57.877 --> 00:13:00.402
I'm not a good nurse, I guess!

00:13:03.149 --> 00:13:05.913
How is Terry now, I wonder?

00:13:06.685 --> 00:13:09.711
Does he work hard in the show business?

00:13:09.889 --> 00:13:13.017
His mother Eleanor Baker
is a famous actress.

00:13:13.092 --> 00:13:15.151
He will do his best to challenge her.

00:13:15.361 --> 00:13:17.329
And I...

00:13:19.298 --> 00:13:21.823
Have one, Miss nurse.

00:13:23.369 --> 00:13:25.462
Do you know me?

00:13:25.604 --> 00:13:28.402
No, it's the first time I see you.

00:13:28.474 --> 00:13:30.669
How do you know that I am a nurse?

00:13:30.743 --> 00:13:33.769
The smell of hospital.

00:13:34.113 --> 00:13:36.741
-The smell?
-Joseph hospital, right?

00:13:36.816 --> 00:13:39.080
You can smell that too?

00:13:39.285 --> 00:13:43.688
No,
It's the largest hospital in the city.

00:13:43.756 --> 00:13:44.745
I see.

00:13:44.824 --> 00:13:49.386
I have stayed in Joseph hospital
for half a year.

00:13:49.461 --> 00:13:52.055
Because of illness?

00:13:53.732 --> 00:13:55.927
I felt so happy then.

00:13:56.001 --> 00:13:58.367
Staying in the hospital make you happy?

00:13:59.238 --> 00:14:03.902
The nurses took care of me
like my daughter.

00:14:03.976 --> 00:14:08.174
They ignored the patient's bad temper.

00:14:08.948 --> 00:14:10.506
Granny?

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.180
Do you mind that?

00:14:13.252 --> 00:14:14.776
No!

00:14:14.854 --> 00:14:18.119
I felt lonely after leaving the hospital.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:21.591
I miss the nurses every day.

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:23.594
Do you live alone?

00:14:23.762 --> 00:14:27.926
I come to the park everyday
to feed these pigeons.

00:14:31.136 --> 00:14:34.731
Nobody cares about me all day.

00:14:34.874 --> 00:14:38.139
I'd rather stay in the hospital
than here.

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.610
I'd like to fall ill again.

00:14:40.746 --> 00:14:43.340
How lonely this granny is!

00:14:43.449 --> 00:14:46.009
She had friends
when she was in the hospital.

00:14:47.052 --> 00:14:49.247
Mr. McGregor must be very lonely.

00:14:49.321 --> 00:14:51.516
That's why he dislikes everybody.

00:15:04.069 --> 00:15:05.798
Are you leaving?

00:15:05.871 --> 00:15:08.396
Yes, I have work to do.

00:15:08.474 --> 00:15:11.034
I am sorry to have bothered you.

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:14.380
No, thank you for your advice.

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:17.577
Be my friend if I fell ill.

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:18.844
Okay!

00:15:27.626 --> 00:15:28.854
Candy!

00:15:30.429 --> 00:15:32.454
Just in time.

00:15:35.034 --> 00:15:38.094
If you had not come back before dark,

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:41.571
I would have sent your luggage
back to Pony's Home.

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:44.973
It's you who wanted me to go to the park.

00:15:45.044 --> 00:15:47.979
A good nurse would not care
about the headmistress...

00:15:48.047 --> 00:15:48.979
but about her patients.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.176
But...

00:15:52.518 --> 00:15:56.318
What shall we do
if Mr. McGregor calls you?

00:15:56.388 --> 00:15:58.549
You mean grandfather William.

00:15:58.624 --> 00:16:02.822
You wished to meet with him, right?

00:16:03.128 --> 00:16:06.120
-But...
-Do what you promised.

00:16:06.632 --> 00:16:09.100
Look after the patients
as best as you can.

00:16:10.669 --> 00:16:16.005
Headmistress,
I'm willing to look after Mr. McGregor.

00:16:16.075 --> 00:16:23.106
The people that get into the hospital
are all patients, treat them equally.

00:16:24.283 --> 00:16:26.717
I'll exchange my shift with Franny.

00:16:26.785 --> 00:16:28.844
That won't be necessary.

00:16:28.921 --> 00:16:30.320
What do you mean?

00:16:30.556 --> 00:16:35.118
Doctor Frank told me that
you are a trouble maker.

00:16:38.764 --> 00:16:40.356
Doctor Frank?

00:16:43.769 --> 00:16:47.227
I already told the headmistress
about everything.

00:16:47.306 --> 00:16:50.935
Mr. McGregor's criticism to me,
I'm willing to improve.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:54.875
Improve it to the next patient.

00:16:56.415 --> 00:16:59.851
Is there any chance to allow me
to look after Mr. McGregor?

00:17:00.019 --> 00:17:02.146
I have told the headmistress.

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:08.091
Doctor Frank
is unwilling to change his mind.

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:10.287
I won't give up.

00:17:13.799 --> 00:17:15.767
It's Annie's father?

00:17:24.543 --> 00:17:26.101
Mr. Brighton.

00:17:29.114 --> 00:17:31.207
-Candy!
-Long time no see.

00:17:31.617 --> 00:17:35.815
I was told by Annie's letter that
you were studying in a nursing school.

00:17:36.422 --> 00:17:38.583
What a surprise!

00:17:38.857 --> 00:17:41.724
Why are you coming here?

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:43.484
To visit a patient.

00:17:43.862 --> 00:17:47.127
I'll show you the way, the ward is here.

00:17:47.533 --> 00:17:49.694
It's alright! I know the way.

00:17:51.837 --> 00:17:53.532
That way is...

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:04.445
The patient whom I pay a visit
is behind that window.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:06.408
Mr. McGregor?

00:18:07.386 --> 00:18:09.616
You know him?

00:18:10.055 --> 00:18:11.579
Allow me!

00:18:11.657 --> 00:18:15.423
It's alright!
The man is not easy to get along.

00:18:15.494 --> 00:18:17.826
You mean... he's always like that.

00:18:17.896 --> 00:18:20.558
Yes! I'm here to bless him.

00:18:20.799 --> 00:18:24.735
Bless him to recover as soon as possible.

00:18:28.707 --> 00:18:30.971
Does Mr. McGregor know that you are here?

00:18:31.677 --> 00:18:34.771
No. It's fine to me.

00:18:35.013 --> 00:18:37.675
-Are you close to each other?
-No!

00:18:37.749 --> 00:18:40.343
We are neighbors around the villa.

00:18:40.419 --> 00:18:43.786
He is not good at being close to people,
but I appreciate him very much.

00:18:43.856 --> 00:18:47.485
I wish him to fully recover
as soon as possible.

00:18:47.559 --> 00:18:51.188
Mr. Brighton,
I will do my best to look after him.

00:18:51.897 --> 00:18:54.866
Please take care of him for me.

00:19:02.341 --> 00:19:03.501
I can't do that!

00:19:03.642 --> 00:19:05.439
As a headmistress...

00:19:05.511 --> 00:19:07.672
I can't change the decision of
the doctor-in-charge.

00:19:07.746 --> 00:19:10.943
I'm willing to look after Mr. McGregor.

00:19:11.016 --> 00:19:14.179
Leave this passion to other patients.

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:18.021
Candy, go take care of Mr. McGregor.

00:19:19.424 --> 00:19:21.892
Has doctor Frank forgiven me?

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:24.585
It is Mr. McGregor's idea.

00:19:24.963 --> 00:19:26.328
I can't believe this.

00:19:26.398 --> 00:19:27.888
I'm going.

00:19:37.843 --> 00:19:40.641
Mr. McGregor,
sorry about what happened yesterday.

00:19:41.446 --> 00:19:43.209
You know Brighton?

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:47.917
You saw everything from the window.

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:53.852
Answer my question.

00:19:54.193 --> 00:19:59.529
Yes, he is Annie's father
who is my good friend.

00:19:59.665 --> 00:20:02.566
What happened to your head?

00:20:04.269 --> 00:20:06.737
Stay if you know Brighton.

00:20:06.805 --> 00:20:09.239
Leave if you don't know him.

00:20:09.308 --> 00:20:10.536
Yes!

00:20:14.813 --> 00:20:16.474
Don't move!

00:20:17.115 --> 00:20:19.743
I'd like to draw the quilt for you.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:24.687
Don't be meddlesome, stay where you are.

00:20:25.123 --> 00:20:28.854
But to stand like this...

00:20:29.528 --> 00:20:31.792
Stay where you are!

00:20:32.197 --> 00:20:33.687
Don't move!

00:20:33.899 --> 00:20:35.025
But...

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:38.900
Give me a shade from the sunset.

00:20:39.738 --> 00:20:42.400
I'll draw the curtain for you.

00:20:42.641 --> 00:20:47.169
Through the curtain,
the sunset cannot be seen.

00:20:50.949 --> 00:20:54.316
Does Mr. McGregor like the sunset?

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:58.615
I told you before,
I hate the nurse who talks too much.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.021
Yes!

00:21:06.665 --> 00:21:12.194
Candy didn't get angry
for being treated as a curtain.

00:21:13.171 --> 00:21:17.540
The look of Mr. McGregor under the shade.

00:21:18.243 --> 00:21:23.146
Same as the look of Terry
who she met first time.
